<title>USA: ITT Corp Q3 net flat.</title>
<headline>ITT Corp Q3 net flat.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.57		    $0.56</p>
<p> Net			 67,000		   67,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,665,000		1,624,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 118,200		  119,000</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.54		    $1.17</p>
<p> Net			183,000		  140,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,805,000		4,640,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 118,400		  119,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for Q3 was $0.55 per share.</p>
<p>1995 figures are pro forma</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
